    <h2>Safety and consent</h2><p>Both people should freely agree to the activity. Check local guidance, physical requirements, transportation, venue rules, food allergies, alcohol preferences, and weather before starting.</p>
    <h2>External services</h2><p>We do not operate venues or third-party services mentioned in general ideas. A link or reference does not guarantee quality, availability, or suitability.</p>
    <h2>Content use</h2><p>Site text, design, and original structure may not be copied or republished as a competing catalog. Source links identify research inputs and do not transfer third-party rights.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>These terms may be updated as analytics, advertising, affiliate links, or new product features are introduced.</p>
  </InfoPage>
</BaseLayout>
